5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings, everyone. It is a pleasure to be in your company. Let us approach this trial with calm hearts and open minds. Trust and wisdom shall be our greatest allies in finding the truth.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree, Servas. A calm approach is always best. Let us be patient with one another as we navigate this situation.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"Hi everyone! I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best to help us find the werewolf! Let's all work together and be honest with each other. I'm looking forward to getting to know you all!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Victoria,,"Thank you, everyone. I agree that a calm and rational approach is necessary. I will be observing our discussions closely to help us identify any inconsistencies. Let us proceed with caution.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,May,,"Such a serious atmosphere already! Let's lighten things up a bit, shall we? I'm sure we'll have plenty of time for ""rational observation"" later. For now, let's just see who's hiding what!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"May, your spirit is refreshing. A little lightness can indeed clear the clouds of suspicion. However, let us remember that beneath a smile, the truth often hides in the quietest moments. I am listening to you all.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,It is true that silence can be revealing. I believe we should give everyone space to speak their mind. I am content to listen and reflect on what is shared.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,I agree with Jonathan! It's important that everyone feels comfortable sharing. Does anyone have any initial thoughts or feelings about how we should start? I'm all ears!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"Since we have no information yet, I believe it is best to listen to how each person expresses themselves. I am interested in seeing who tries to lead the conversation and who remains passive.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, watching me that closely? I'm flattered! But don't be too focused on who's leading; sometimes the most interesting things happen when you're just relaxing. I'm just here to enjoy the game!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, my friends. While the desire to uncover the truth is strong, let us not rush. I feel a positive energy among us; let us nurture it so that we may trust one another.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I find Servas's perspective quite soothing. In times of uncertainty, maintaining our inner peace allows us to see things more clearly. I am happy to follow this gentle pace for now.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"You're both so calm, it's really helping me relax! I'm feeling much better now. I hope we can keep this friendly vibe going even when things get a bit more intense!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"It is comforting that we are all at ease, but we must not let comfort blind us. While the atmosphere is friendly, we should remain mindful that the werewolf is among us, likely mirroring this same friendliness.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,May,,"@Victoria, you're such a killjoy! Always bringing us back to the scary part. Why not just enjoy the mystery? I'm sure the werewolf is just as nervous as Yumi is!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, Victoria's vigilance is a necessary balance to our peace. Let us embrace both the warmth of friendship and the clarity of caution. I wish you all a restful night; may the truth reveal itself.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I wish you all a peaceful night as well. May we wake tomorrow with a clearer understanding of our situation. Sleep well, everyone.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Yumi,,"Goodnight, everyone! I hope we all have sweet dreams and wake up feeling refreshed. I'll be cheering for us to find the werewolf tomorrow! Sleep tight!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Victoria,,Goodnight. I will be reflecting on our initial interactions tonight. I hope that tomorrow's revelations will provide the clarity we need to move forward. Sleep well.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,May,,"Goodnight, everyone! Try not to let the monsters under your bed keep you awake. I'll be dreaming of something much more exciting than ""rational reflection."" See you all tomorrow!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,,action,Victoria,May,WEREWOLF,"{""action"":""divine"",""result"":""WEREWOLF"",""valid"":true,""raw"":""May""}"
