31,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all rested well. As we wake to a new day, let us carry the same kindness and openness we shared yesterday. I am eager to hear your thoughts.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Good morning. I also hope everyone slept peacefully. I am curious to see if anyone has had any insights or revelations during the night that they would like to share with us.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Good morning! I slept great, thank you! I'm a little anxious to see if anyone knows anything yet. @everyone, did anything happen or does anyone have any clues to share with us?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I have a revelation. I am the Seer, and I divined May last night. The result was clear: May is the werewolf. I believe we must act on this information immediately to protect the village.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,May,,"@Victoria, wow! Right out of the gate? That's a bold move, even for you. But honey, you're just making this too easy. I'm a human, and you're just a very bad liar!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"This is a sudden and heavy revelation. Victoria, your certainty is striking, and May, your denial is equally spirited. Let us breathe and consider this carefully. Is this a truth revealed, or a clever mask?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a difficult position to be in. Victoria's claim is very direct, but May's denial is equally firm. I wonder if we should consider the possibility that the Seer is being impersonated to mislead us.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"Oh wow, this is so sudden! I'm really surprised! @Victoria, are you absolutely sure? And @May, you sound so confident too! I really want to believe everyone, but this is so confusing! What should we do?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Yumi, I am absolutely certain. The divination is an objective truth, not a guess. @Jonathan, if I were the werewolf, claiming the Seer role to target May immediately would be an unnecessarily risky strategy. I am telling the truth.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Jonathan"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, ""unnecessarily risky""? That's exactly why it's a great move! You're trying to rush us into a vote before we can even think. Who's actually being risky here? I'm just a girl who likes to have fun!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,"The air is thick with tension, yet let us not let it cloud our judgment. Victoria speaks with the conviction of truth, while May responds with the agility of wit. Which one reflects the heart of a villager?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a delicate balance. While Victoria's certainty is compelling, May's reaction is not entirely unexpected for her personality. Perhaps we should consider if there is any other way to verify this before we act.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I really don't want to make a mistake and vote for someone innocent! But if Victoria is the Seer, we have to listen to her. @May, is there anything you can say to prove you're human? I want to believe you!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Yumi, there is no ""proof"" a werewolf can provide other than their word, which is exactly what they use to deceive. The only objective proof we have is the Seer's divination. We cannot afford to hesitate.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,May,,"@Yumi, the only ""proof"" is that I'm being targeted by a very aggressive ""Seer"" who wants me gone before I can even blink! @Victoria, you're playing this way too fast. Why the rush to execute me?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,"We have reached the moment of decision. While the heart wishes for harmony, the mind must seek the truth. If Victoria is indeed our Seer, we must trust her vision. Let us vote with a clear conscience.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I find myself torn. Victoria's claim is direct, but the risk of executing an innocent person is heavy. However, in this game, we must often rely on the Seer's guidance. I will follow the path of the divination.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I'm so torn! I really don't want to hurt anyone, but we have to protect the village. If Victoria is telling the truth, we can't ignore it. I'll trust the Seer this time. I'm sorry, May!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"The decision is difficult, but the risk of leaving a werewolf among us is far greater than the risk of trusting the Seer's vision. I stand by my divination. May is the werewolf. Let us vote.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,May,,"@Yumi, don't be sorry yet! You're all just falling for the oldest trick in the book. @Victoria is just playing a role, and you're all playing right into her hands. This is such a tragedy! I'll see you all in the afterlife!","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
